### hilavitkutin-frozen-authors

Work units written the way a consumer writes them, beside a hand model of
what a frame of them computes, and frozen: once landed, a file of this crate
changes only through a line in its `BREAKS.toml`, and a lint fails when a
file's content no longer matches its `LEDGER.toml` hash. The units are in the
value form, one of them reads its neighbours on two axes, and between them
they emit every kind of trigger. `no_std`, no alloc. Depends on
`hilavitkutin-api` and on the engine for the context type a unit names. Its
tests run the units under the reference runner and under each entry of the
scheduler and hold the two to each other.
